---
title: "try_borrow_asset (Pebble Protocol: Obligation)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_name: name = type_name of CoinType
    q_get_name --> q_check_existing: debts.contains(CoinType)?
    q_check_existing --> q_first_borrow: no (first borrow)
    q_check_existing --> q_subsequent: yes (existing debt)
    q_first_borrow --> q_check_collateral: assert !ctokens.is_supporting_collateral(CoinType)
    q_check_collateral --> q_error_collateral: is collateral
    q_error_collateral --> [*]: abort obligation_borrow_collateral_asset
    q_check_collateral --> q_init_debt: add new Debt(amount, borrow_index) to debts
    q_init_debt --> [*]: return amount
    q_subsequent --> q_accrue: accrue_interest(CoinType, asset_borrow_index)
    q_accrue --> q_increase: debt.unsafe_increase(amount)
    q_increase --> [*]: return debt.unsafe_debt_amount()

    note right of q_check_collateral
        INV-001: an asset cannot be both collateral and borrowed in same obligation
        INV-002: first borrow records the current borrow_index snapshot
    end note

    note right of q_accrue
        INV-003: interest accrued: new_amount = amount * new_index / old_index
        INV-004: borrow_index must be monotonically increasing
    end note
